    "updated_at": "2021-07-26T17:56:33Z",
    "body": "Yep, you are welcome to open a feature request for that. Though I would not have high hopes for it, because it's hard to define what `root` is. Starship already support Git repo as root but it can also be, as you have mentioned, `~` or `C:`, but there are more like `/mnt/c` and the list goes on.",
